        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="key-text" value="Purple dashed = provisioning / role assumption. Green = runtime invocation. Blue = user / application access. Teal = telemetry.&lt;br&gt;Inference Gateway is an endpoint in the Control Plane API repository and API containers. Accounts C and D authenticate with API keys.&lt;br&gt;Harness currently invokes Bedrock directly in its execution account. Network routes, hosting assumptions and ADOT placement remain to be confirmed." style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#53677C;fontFamily=DejaVu Sans;fontSize=17;spacing=12;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;align=left;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="key">
